title: XenServer / XCP-ng: Host memory
agents: xenserver
catalog: app/citrix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check shows the memory usage of a XenServer host (memory assigned to
 VMs and the hypervisor) and the memory still free for new VMs. No levels are
 set by default because a well utilized host is normal. Data comes from the
 special agent {agent_xenserver}.

discovery:
 One service {XenServer Host Memory} per host.
